  "changelog": "Initial release \u2014 a complete closed-loop English learning engine for Chinese speakers using TV series and movies.\n\n- One-stop workflow: input any TV episode or movie name/code to start a guided learning loop (words, listening, reading, speaking, writing, review).\n- Agent autonomously retrieves and verifies public subtitles, prioritizing legality and non-infringement (no storage or unauthorized usage).\n- Offers pre-learning CEFR proficiency diagnostics (by exam score or adaptive quiz).\n- Generates structured learning outputs (words, listening, annotation, and tasks) in multiple formats (HTML, Anki, Excel, Word, Markdown).\n- Supports both TV series and films, with workflow tailored for Chinese native speakers.\n- Each reply includes author attribution and a legal disclaimer.",
